  "description": "Simple, lightweight, and developer-friendly logging library for .NET applications. Features one-line setup, async and thread-safe logging, daily files, size-based rotation, auto cleanup, exception logging, caller info, session tracking, and text/JSON output.",
  "id": "EasyLogWriter",
  "isPrerelease": false,
