  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0 — Extensibility foundation (backward compatible). Adds: public custom sink API (ILogSink) for SQL/Mongo/HTTP/etc., log enrichers (MachineName, AppVersion, Environment, ProcessId, ThreadId), runtime diagnostics counters (Logger.Diagnostics), and a Logger.Log(level, ...) bridge method. Companion package EasyLogWriter.Extensions.Logging adds Microsoft.Extensions.Logging (ILogger/ILoggerProvider) and DI support.",
